OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry night
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and clear spells.
OL,7,FWinds remaining light, with the odd
OL,8,Fmist and fog patch forming in prone
OL,9,Fspots. A chillier night than on
OL,10,FWednesday night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FEarly low cloud clears leaving
OL,13,Fa bright and dry day for many with
OL,14,Flight winds. Feeling pleasant in the
OL,15,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
