OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FThere
OL,6,Fremains a risk of fog overnight which
OL,7,Fmay linger through the morning at
OL,8,Ftimes. Otherwise, dry and sunny on
OL,9,FSaturday then cloudier on Sunday, with
OL,10,Fsunshine returning on Monday.
